  "review": {
    "images": "Aldar’s launch gallery and corporate page identify the architecture, lobby and residence imagery. The two corporate assets used here are the named Saadiyat exterior and Sky Villa bedroom. The latter is labelled as a villa example. Corporate page: https://www.aldar.com/properties/en/uae/saadiyat-island/baccarat-residences-saadiyat",
    "location": "Aldar’s location-section aerial matches the Saadiyat Grove waterfront project position. A Benham and Reeves image advertised as Baccarat’s map was excluded because it labels The Arthouse. Property Finder gives the displayed Saadiyat Island estimates. Other broker times differ and no entrance was independently confirmed.",
    "floorPlans": "Visually reviewed the two PDF Type A plans and all 27 complete public Baccarat Saadiyat-branded drawings hosted by UAE Projects. The two Type A drawings duplicate the PDF examples, so their PDF pages are retained and the 25 additional images added. Labels follow each printed plan rather than broker categories. Penthouse drawings do not print bedroom counts or totals. Broker size estimates conflict and are not assigned to drawings."
  },
